msgid "Audit programme coverage"
msgstr ""

msgid "The audit programme must cover the whole ISMS over the certification cycle. For each ISMS requirement and each applicable control, this page shows the last internal audit that gave it a result in its audit checklist, and lists first those never audited over the period. Cancelled audits and lines left \"Not audited\" do not count; the date is the actual date of the audit, otherwise its planned date."
msgstr ""

