msgid "Audited over the period (%d %%)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Never audited over the period"
msgstr ""

msgid "No ISMS requirement nor applicable control to show."
msgstr ""

msgid "Last audit"
msgstr ""

msgid "Never audited"
msgstr ""

msgid "The audit checklist is reserved to the audit team and the CISO group, like the documents of the audit. Ask the audit owner to add you to the \"Team\" tab."
msgstr ""

msgid "Lines with a result"
msgstr ""

msgid "Audit report (PDF)"
msgstr ""

msgid "One line per audited requirement: write the question you asked, who you interviewed, the evidence you examined (text, and documents of the \"Documents\" tab), then the result. For a non-conformity, an observation or an opportunity for improvement, \"Create the finding\" opens a pre-filled non-conformity that you review and save yourself. Like the documents of the audit, only the audit team and the CISO group see this checklist."
msgstr ""

msgid "This audit is completed or cancelled: its checklist is read only. Set the audit back to \"In progress\" to change it."
msgstr ""

